## smem-store-in.soar -- object-world: 1 elaboration.

## Elaborate smem-store-object in-location first-time -> sets store, s.
sp {object-world*elaborate*smem-store-object*in-location*first-time
   :default
   :o-support
   (state <s> ^superstate nil
              ^scene.objects.object <object>
              ^flags.smem-store true
              ^scene.in <in>
              ^smem.command <cmd>)
   (<in> ^argument1 <object>)
  -(<in> ^smem-stored true)
-->
   (<cmd> ^store <in>)
   (<in> ^smem-stored true)
}
